\id 2TI  
\h 2 Timothy 
\toc1 Timothy Henga Paul Lekha Thot Nina 
\toc2 2 Timothy 
\toc3 2 Tim 
\mt1 TIMOTHY  
\mt2 HENGA  
\mt3 PAUL LEKHA THOT NINA  
\is1 Thiding kon Lekhathot  
\is1 Paul'in achaina dia thutah vengbit le peson dinga Timothy angeh  
\is1 2 Timothy lekhabu sung thu  
\ip Thil hahsatah dinmun'a kon achaina Solchah Paul in ajih ahi. Paul dinga angailut aseijui henga dinmun hahsa jouse nunga alekhathot ahi. Paul in lainatah'a ahilchahna a kon Timothy bitkeiya ahung kilena hi eiho jouse dinga vetton umtah ahi. Kipaman simjou lou—Gospel Thupha dihtah le ngailutna keoseh, hahsatna jouse thoh, Pathen in ahaikhum athuhinga kisong in Gospel Thupha alhangsam jingin ahi.  
\is1 Lekhathot jihpa chule ajih kum  
\ip Solchah Paul in Timothy henga ajih ahi, hichu AD 66-67 sunga Rome songkul anivei channa atan laiya ajih ahi.  
\is1 Thusim chedol  
\ip Solchah Paul ani-channan songkul atang in, anung jui ho ding chun avel'a akilhadoh kit ding chu kinepna beihel ahitai. Nero khut'a kon in tahsan cha tamtah suhgimin aumtan, Paul dingin leiset hinkho chu sotta lou ding ahitai, ti ahetan ahi. Dinmun hahsatna ho, atundoh Houbung ho chule angailut Timothy hicheng ho jouse dinga achaina athucheng ho ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Salam thu  
\p
\v 1 Hiche hi Yeshua Christa solchah hidinga Pathen lunglhaina-a lhendoh a um Paul lekhathot ahi. Keima Christa Yeshua tahsan a kon hinna athutep seiphong dinga eikisol'ah ahi.  
\v 2 Kangailuttah kachapa Timothy dinga kajih ahi. Pa Pathen le I-Pakaiyu Yeshua Christa ngailutna le khotona chuleh lungmon na chun naumpi hen.\x + \xo 1:2 \xt Act 16:1\x*   
\s1 Jachat louding  
\p
\v 3 Timothy, kapu kapaten apom banga selepha hetna lunggel thengtah puma kapom Pathen chu nang jal'in kathangvah e. Asun ajan in kataona a nangma kageldoh jinge.  
\v 4 I-kikhen a namitlhilon chu kageldoh in, nangma kamukit nom lheh jenge. Chule iumkhom kit tengleh keima kipana a dimset ding kahitai.  
\v 5 Natahsan dihtah chu kageldoh e, ajehchu napi Lois leh nanu Eunice a anaumdim masa tahsan chu nachan khompi ahi. Chule hiche tahsan chu nang'ah dettah in aum jinge ti kahen ahi.\x + \xo 1:5 \xt Act 16:1\x*  
\v 6 Hichejeh achu, nachunga kakhut kangap a Pathen in lhagao thilpeh napeh chu nasuhlang jing dinga kahin geldohsahkit nahi.  
\v 7 Ajehchu Pathen in tijatna le meisanna Lhagao eipepouve, amavang thohhatna, ngailutna chule kitimthemna joh eipeuve.   
\s1 Pakai jachatpi lou ding  
\p
\v 8 I-Pakaiyu chung thu midang seipeh ding jahcha hih beh-in, chuleh ama jeh a songkul katan jeh hin keima jong neijachatpi hih in. Pathen in napeh thahatna chu kengin lang hiche kipana thupha jeh a hi thohgimna toh dingin kigosan um'in.  
\v 9 Ajehchu Pathen in eihuhdoh uva hinkho thenga hing dinga eikouvu ahi. Hichehi eiho ichandiu lom a eibolpeh-u ahipon, amavang phat kipat masangpeh a ama tohgon dungjuia abol ahibouve, amikhotona Yeshua Christa a kona eivetsah nom jal u ahi.  
\v 10 Tun eihuhhingpau Yeshua Christa ahung kilah chun hiche hohi eihet chetsah u ahitai. Aman thina thahat chu asumangin athupha hi mangchan thithei louna leh hinna lampi chu eisalvah peh tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 Chule Pathen in hiche kipana thuphahi hillhangle dinga solchah khat'a eilhendoh ahitai.\x + \xo 1:11 \xt 1 Tim 2:7\x*  
\v 12 Hichejeh-a chu, keiman hiche songkul'a hi kathohgim ahi. Ahinlah keima kajah achapoi, ajeh chu keiman katahsan chu kahechenin chuleh ama ahungkit kah-a achunga kakingap lhahna dungjuiya hi eikaihoi jing ding ahi ti katahsanin ahi.   
\s1 Tahsan det  
\p
\v 13 Keima a kona nahet thuhil dihtah Yeshua Christa a nanei tahsan le ngailutnaa kisemdoh chu chepin.  
\v 14 I-sunguva chengah Lhagao Theng thaneina a kon chun nangman nakingansena thutah manlutah chu chingthei tah in kichin tup in.  
\v 15 Nahet ngaima bangin Asia gamkaiya kona hungho jouse Phygelus le Hermogenes changei chun eidalhagam tauvin ahi.  
\v 16 Pakaiyin ahepina giltah chun Onesiphorus leh ainsungmite umpi hen ajehchu aman eihung vil in eihung tilkhou jinge. Kabul put jongchu aman eijachat pipon ahi.  
\v 17 Ama Rome a ahung chun eihung mudoh kahsen muntin'ah eihol len ahi.  
\v 18 Pakai chu ahung kilekit nileh angailutna giltah chun umpi hen, chuleh Ephesus mun a chu itobang tah a phachom'ah hitam nangman nahesohnai.   
\c 2  
\s1 Christa milungsetna'a chun hat in  
\p
\v 1 Timothy kangailuttah kachapa, Yeshua Christa a um Pathen in napeh hiche lungsetna a chun hat in.  
\v 2 Tahsan theitah hettohsah tamtah'in asuhdet kathuhil hochu nangman najatan ahi. Tun nangin hiche thutah hohi tahsan thei miho chu hilin, chutileh amahon midangho koma apehdoh sondiu ahi.  
\v 3 Yeshua Christa sepai phatah bangin ahahsa kathohhi neithohpin.  
\v 4 Sepai galkap pet koima leiset hinkho thil ho dingin akisalelpoi, ajeh chu hiche chun sepaiya apansahpa alunglhai sah theipon ahi.  
\v 5 Chuleh golseh kitetna ajong koiman dan juilouvin kipaman asang ngaipoi.  
\v 6 Chule natong hat loubol mi jong atohga nemasapen a pang dingdol ahi.  
\v 7 Kathusei hi hoitah'in geltoh them in, Pakaiyin hichehohi nahetthem sahding ahi.  
\v 8 Yeshua Christa hi leng David chilhah ahin, athia kona kaithouva um ahi tia kathuhil hi phat tinin geldoh jingin.  
\v 9 Chuleh hiche kipana thupha thohgimna hohi kato ahi. Amavang Pathen thuhi akikham tang theidehpoi.  
\v 10 Pathen in alhendoh ho dinga huhhingna le Christa a tonsot loupina ahinpohlut ding ahiphot le itobang thohgimna hijongleh thohding kanom in ahi.  
\v 11 Hiche hi tahsan umtah thuhil ahi: Amatoh ithikhom uleh amatoh ihinkhom diu ahi.  
\v 12 Amatoh ithohgim khom uleh amatoh ivaihom khomdiu ahi, ama iseilep uleh amanjong eiseilep diu ahi.\x + \xo 2:12 \xt Matt 10:33; Lk 12:9\x*  
\v 13 Ahinlah eihon kitahna neihih jongleu hen amachu kitahjing ahi, ijeh inem itileh ama chu amaleh ama kiseilep theilou ahi.   
\s1 Kinel baotamna a pang hih in  
\p
\v 14 Nangman hichethu hohi mijouse geldohsah in, chule phatchomna bei mohthu pouva akinel bautam louna dingun Pathen anga hilchah in. Ajehchu hitobang kinelna hochun ajaho lungthim asuhset ding ahi.  
\v 15 Pathen lunglhaina nachan theina dingin ama a dingin kiphal thengin, gunchun Pathen thuhi jachatna beihelin adihna bangtah in hilchenin lang ponpanin.  
\v 16 Pathen nahsah louna thu phachomlou ngolkai thu kihoulimna'a konin kikangse in,  
\v 17 Hitobang thuphalou hohi tahsa a hivei phalou tobanga, Hymenaeus le Philetus chunga soh tobanga chu, kithejal ji ahi.  
\v 18 Amahohi thutah'a kona lamvai ahiuvin, mithiho chu thoudohsa ahitauve atiuvin miphabep khat tahsanna lama konin alehei tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Ahinlah Pathen thudih hi khombul kiphut detchet bangin adingdet jingin achungah hiche thuhi akijih in ahi, “Pakaiyin ama hochu koikoi ahi ahen chuleh Pakai mite chu thilsea konin akiheimang jiuve,” akiti.\x + \xo 2:19 \xt Minbu 16:5\x*  
\v 20 Mihao insunga chun sana le dangka a kisem thilkeo ngen aumpon thingle leibel jong aumin, amantamho chu kinthupia kimang chading ahin, aman lhomho chu nitina manchah hiding ahiuve.  
\v 21 Nangma nakisuhtheng jinga ahileh kinloupia manchahthei thilkeo thupi chu nahi ding ahi. Nahinkho chu theng ding Pakaiyin thilphachoma amanchah dinga kigosa jing chu nahi ahi.  
\v 22 Khandonlai lungngaichat ho jousea konin jammangin, amavang chonphatna, kitahna, ngailutna le chamna chu hadel in, lungthengsel a Pakai kom beljingho toh kiloikhomin,  
\v 23 Avel in seikit inge, ngol hoitah, ima hetohlouva kinel bautamna hoa konchun kikangse doh in, hichun kinahna asodohsah jin ahi.  
\v 24 Chuleh Pakai lhacha chun mitoh kinah abollou ding, amavang mijouse angailut ding, mihilthem hiding, chuleh mihahsa ho chu adepthem ding ahi.  
\v 25 Thutah doudal hochu kangkhen chan hilthem in ajeh chu amaho lungthim chu Pathen in aleheiya thutah chu ahin hetthem thei diu ahi.  
\v 26 Hiteng chuleh amaho hung khangdoh untin, Diabol thangkol a kona hoidoh theidiu ahi. Ajeh chu aman amaho chu adei deiya abolthei dinga gal hinga anamat ahitai.   
\c 3  
\s1 Phat hahsa le mihem phalou  
\p
\v 1 Timothy, ni nunung tengleh phat hahsa hunglhung ding ahi ti nahet ding ahi.  
\v 2 Ajehchu mihon amachang kingailutna le sum ngailutna jengbou ahinnei diu ahi. Amahohin kiletsahna le husetna, Pathen taitomna, nulepa thungai louna chule kipaje helou hung hitei diu ahi. Amahon thenna hinkho hi ahin nahsahlou diu ahi.  
\v 3 Amaho chun ngailutnale ngaidam jouna aneilou diu, miseiset hat hidiu chule ama kitim jouna neilou hidiu ahi. Amahohi kichat um phatna hoa ahiuve.  
\v 4 Amahon aloi agol ho hinpedoh untin, i-ang untin, kiletsahnan dimuntin, Pathen ngaisah sanga nopsahna ahin ngaichat joh diu ahi.  
\v 5 Amaho chu hougut hiuvintin, ahinlah amahon Pathen thaneinale athilbol theina ajahnomlou diu ahi. Hitobang hoa kon hin kikangsen,  
\v 6 Amaho doha lungthim in mi insunga alutjiuvin, tahsa ngaichatnan alodim chonset pohgih poa numei tikitimlou ho alhemlhauvin gal hingin amanjiuvin ahi.  
\v 7 Hitobang numeiho hin, thuhil thah hi ajui jingun ahinlah thutah chu ahethem pouvin ahi.  
\v 8 Jannes le Jambres tenin Mose adoudal lhon bang chun amaho hin thutah chu adoudalun ahi. Amahohin lungthim chavai aneiyun tahsan lhem achepiuvin ahi.\x + \xo 3:8 \xt Potdohbu 7:11\x*  
\v 9 Ahinlah amahohi hitiahi hoidoh sottaloudiu Jannes le Jambres banga chu itobanga ngol hiuvam ti nikhatleh mijousen ahin hetdoh diu ahi.   
\s1 Pathen mi le Pathen thu  
\p
\v 10 Ahinlah Timothy keiman, nangma ipi thu kahil, chule ipi iti kahin chule kahinkhoa kalunggon nahet ahinai. Hiti chun nangman katahsanna, kathohhatna, kangailutna chule kathoh lhumkeina hohi nahe chen nai.  
\v 11 Ichan geiya gimbol hesohna chule hahsatna kathoh hitam ti nahenai. Chule keiman Antioch, Iconium chule Lystra khohoa bol-hesohna kathoh hohi nahei, hinla Pakaiyin hicheho jousea konin eihuhdoh tai.\x + \xo 3:11 \xt Act 13:14-52; \xt Act 14:1-7; \xt Act 14:8-20\x*  
\v 12 Ahiye chule koi koi hijongleh Christa Yeshua a Pathen ngaisahna hinkho mangnom jouse chun bolhesohna athohtei ding ahi.  
\v 13 Ahinlah migilouho leh milhem lhaho chu hung pungcheh cheh ding ahiuve. Amahon midangho alheplhah uva chule amaho tah lheplhah a umding ahiuve.  
\v 14 Ahinlah nangma nana kihilsa thilhoa chu tahsan umtah nahi ding ahi. Nangman hicheho chu adih ahin, chule nahil ho chu natahsan thei ahiuve ti nahenai.  
\v 15 Nangma naneova pat a Thuthengbu hi nana kihilsa ahin, chule amaho chun huhhingna nakisan theina dinga chihna chu napehsonu ahitai.  
\v 16 Pathen thubu hi aboncha Pathen Hu haikhum ahi chule hichu eiho dinga ipi chu adih chule ipi chu adihlou ham ti ihinkhouva eihet dohsah dingu ahi. Idihlou tenguleh eisudih diu chule ipi chu adih ham ti eihiluva panga ahi.  
\v 17 Hiche hi Pathen in amite chu abolsah nom thilpha tincheng bolna lama boltheina dimset inei theina diuva kigotna lampi ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Pathen thu seidia ngehna  
\p
\v 1 Keiman Pathen le alenggam tungdoh a hung ding Christa Yeshua, ahingho le athiho chungthu tana pang dingpa angsunga, lungguttah a katilkhou nahi:  
\v 2 Pathen Thu chu seiphong in. Phat kijenpet hihen, hihih jongleh kigosademin um'in. Thohhattah in sudih in, phoh in chule phatah a hilpumin namiteu chu tilkhouvin.  
\v 3 Ajehchu mihon thuhilpha le adihtah a kihilna thu angainom lounau phat hunglhung ding ahi. Amaho chun alung ngaichat u ajui uva, anakolu thahtun tun'a um chun angainom ding thubou hilding mihil akikou dingu ahi.  
\v 4 Amaho chun thutah chu adeilou dingu chule akisemthu thusimho pou adel le dingu ahi.  
\v 5 Hinlah nangma aphat totoh'a imalam jousea lunggel kicheh hina neiyin. Pakaiya dinga gimhesoh thohding kichatna neihih in. Kipana Thupha thu chu hilin chule Pathen in lhacha natohna napeh chu tongdoh in.  
\v 6 Keima vang kahinkho hi Pathena dinga maichama kisunglha kahitai. Ka leihinkho kichaina ding ahung naitai.  
\v 7 Keiman kidouna chu kasat chaitai, keiman lhaitetna chu kajo ahitai chule tahsanna a kapangdet e.  
\v 8 Chule tua hi kipaman kasan ding gotsa koi ahitai. Pakai, thutan dihtah pa chun, ahungkile nitengleh chonphatna lallukhuh chu eipeh ding ahi. Chule hiche kipaman san ding chu keima chang dingseh hilouva Ama hung kilah ding nikho ngaicha geova ngah jing ho dinga jong ahi.  
\v 9 Timothy, lungsettah in agan nathei chanin hungin.  
\v 10 Demas chun tu hinkho thil ho angaichat jeh in keima eidalhan, Thessalonica lama achetai. Crescens chu Galatia ah achen, chule Titus Dalmatia ah achetai.\x + \xo 4:10 \xt Col 4:14; Phile 1:24; \xt 2 Crth 8:23; Gal 2:3; Tit 1:4\x*  
\v 11 Luke bouseh kakoma aume. Nahung phatleh Mark chu hinpuiyin, ajeh chu ama lhacha natohnaa eipanpi phachomtah hiding ahi.\x + \xo 4:11 \xt Col 4:14; Phile 1:24; \xt Act 12:12,25; 13:13; 15:37-39; Col 4:10; Phile 1:24\x*  
\v 12 Keiman Tychicus chu Ephesus a kasol in ahi.\x + \xo 4:12 \xt Act 20:4; Eph 6:21,22; Col 4:7,8\x*  
\v 13 Nahung phatleh Troas khoa Carpus koma kadalhah Sangkholchol chu hinpo teiyin. Chujongleh kalekhabu ho, adeh'a kalekhajol ho chu hinpon.\x + \xo 4:13 \xt Act 20:6\x*  
\v 14 Alexander, sum-eng khengpa chun eigimbol lheh jenge, hinlah Pakaiyin athilbol dungjuiyin achungthu tan nante.\x + \xo 4:14 \xt 1 Tim 1:20; \xt Labu 62:12; Rm 2:6\x*  
\v 15 Amaa konin chingtheiyin, ajeh chu amahin isei jouseu hadouvin adouvin ahi.  
\v 16 Thutanna anga eikipui masat chun koima eikilhonpia aumpoi. Amitinin eidalhauve. Ama ho dounaa ima sodahen.   
\s1 Pakai chu kitah ahi  
\p
\v 17 Hinlah Pakai chun eidinpin chule thaneina eipei hitia chu keiman chidang namdang ho jouse henga Kipana Thupha kalhangsap chu ajah theina dingu ahi. Chule aman thina theiya konin jong eihuh dohtai.  
\v 18 Henge, hitia chu Pakaiyin gitlouna eihin nokhum theiya konin eihuhdoh intin, chule avan gam'a bitkeiya eipuilut ding ahi. Pathena chun loupina jouse umjing tahen! Amen.  
\v 19 Priscilla le Aquila teni chule Onisephorus insunga umho jouse chu keikhelin analemin.\x + \xo 4:19 \xt Act 18:2; \xt 2 Tim 1:16,17\x*  
\v 20 Erastus Corinth a aumdenin, chule keiman Trophimus chu Miletas ah damlouvin kadalhatai.\x + \xo 4:20 \xt Act 19:22; Rm 16:23; \xt Act 20:4; 21:29\x*  
\v 21 Phalbi ma-in hikoma hung teijin. Eubulus in chibai nahinbol e, chule Pudente, Linus, Claudia chule sopi ho jousen jong chibai nahinbol uve.  
\v 22 Pakai chun nalhagaovu umpi hen. Chule Amilungsetna chun nabonchauvin naumpiuhen.   